# Incetro security

- Do not hardcode secrets, tokens, or credentials.
- Validate input at trust boundaries.
- Keep generated paths inside the project root.
- Do not execute code from project configuration.
- Treat `.incetro-ecc.json` as data.
- Do not overwrite project-owned files to make an install succeed.
